	(text "F1 (100 mA PTC, SMD0603-010-24V) fuses the 3.3 V on J3 pin 5: a short on a\nplug-in board trips F1, not the CM5 rail. HAT budget 100 mA; CN1 has F3."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
